<title>UK: Tesco says EU clears ABF Irish purchase.</title>
<headline>Tesco says EU clears ABF Irish purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail foods group Tesco Plc said on Tuesday that the European Commission had approved its purchase of the Irish retail business of Associated British Foods.</p>
<p>The 630 million stg takeover was approved by the Commission's merger task force, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
